<tr><td>Context handoff / recovery</td><td>CURRENT</td><td>WORK-LAB工作流元数据</td><td>packages/client-neutral-core/scripts/build_context_pack.py</td><td>scope/hash/checkpoint/证据包，不复制知识业务truth</td><td>需要真实跨会话与消费端回读</td></tr>
<tr><td>Model/provider policy</td><td>CURRENT</td><td>WORK-LAB控制面</td><td>packages/client-neutral-core/scripts/model_capability_resolver.py</td><td>权限/预算/能力候选计划，模型推理外置</td><td>纯函数复核发现优先级/能力/稳定性缺陷</td></tr>
<tr><td>Local model asset registry</td><td>CURRENT</td><td>WORK-LAB共享资源登记</td><td>.project/governance/model-registry.json</td><td>单份外置权重、按项目权限消费</td><td>登记有交叉引用与状态冲突</td></tr>
<tr><td>Runtime inference</td><td>PROVIDER</td><td>LMStudio/llama.cpp/ASR库</td><td>.project/governance/runtime-registry.json</td><td>由外部runtime完成</td><td>本轮只读云端记录，未连接用户Windows</td></tr>
